  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sound Waves Getaways by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>Freshly remodeled in 2023, this stylish Seacrest Beach home has plenty of space to stretch out, relax, and make yourself at home. It's tucked on a quiet street, with porches on every level and a peaceful backyard that feels like your own little hideaway.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Seacrest Beach<br>🛏️ 3 bedrooms, 3 baths<br>🏖️ .4 miles from private beach access<br>👣 100 steps to giant community resort pool and amphitheater<br>😎 Complimentary community tram, to beach and back<br>🚲 3 bikes!<br>🔥 Gas grill<br>🦞 4-star restaurants<br>🛍️ Fun eateries and boutiques<br> <br>On the first floor, a primary bedroom with a private bath offers comfort and space to recharge. The open living area features all-new furniture, a dining table for 10, and a huge kitchen island with seating for four more.<br><br>Upstairs, there’s a guest room with two queen beds and a spacious bathroom with a soaking tub and separate shower. A full porch off the room is perfect for morning coffee or a quiet escape. Down the hall, a fun bunk room features three XL twin bunks, its own bath, and another private porch overlooking the backyard.<br><br>The third floor is a flexible space with a queen sleeper sofa, a desk, and a play area for kids. Every bedroom opens to a porch, making it easy to enjoy the quiet outside.<br><br>Outside, the private backyard is calm and leafy, with space to relax after a beach day. There’s an outdoor shower, walk-in laundry room, and parking for two cars. And the beach? Just a short walk or tram ride away! Enjoy.<br><br>Oversee 30A is local and here when you need us, every day, with a 24/7 emergency line just in case.<br><br>Overview:<br>- (.4 mile) to beach (private access)<br>- (.1 mile) to the resort pool and amphitheater (seasonal concerts)<br>- Complimentary tram service to beach and back (March-October)<br>- 3 bedroom, 3 bath<br>- 2,254 Sq. Ft.<br>- Wifi<br>- Gas grill<br>- 3 bikes included<br> <br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, private bath, TV<br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Guest Bedroom: Two queen beds, private bath, TV<br>- Bunk Room: 6 twin XLs bunks, private bath, TV<br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- Queen sleeper sofa in living area<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Check-out is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
